  "course_description": "The positioning terms used in Radiology will be discussed including projections, positions, body planes, and tube directions. Specific positioning lecture and labs will be held on the positioning terms, chest, upper extremity & shoulder girdle. This course will also introduce theories of disease causation and the pathophysiologic disorders that compromise healthy systems. The course content is also designed to provide an introduction to the origins of medical terminology. This course is designed to establish a knowledge base in anatomy and physiology.",
